<div class="rme-panel">
    <section id="rme-print-controls" class="rme-card" data-bind="visible: tuneAvailable">
        <h4>RME print controls</h4>
        <p>Live printer state. Changes apply during printing without changing saved light profiles.</p>
        <div data-bind="visible: tuneLight() >= 0">
            <label for="rme-light-mode">Chamber light: <strong data-bind="text: ['Off', 'On', 'Locked'][tuneLight()]"></strong></label>
            <input id="rme-light-mode" type="range" min="0" max="2" step="1" aria-label="Chamber light: Off, On, Locked"
                data-bind="rmeLightState: tuneLight, event: {change: changeTuneLight}, enable: tuneEnabled">
            <div class="rme-light-positions"><span>Off</span><span>On (timed)</span><span>Locked on</span></div>
        </div>
        <div data-bind="visible: tuneLcd() >= 0">
            <label>LCD: <strong data-bind="text: tuneLcd() > 0 ? 'On' : 'Off'"></strong></label>
            <input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="1" aria-label="LCD Off or On"
                data-bind="rmeLightState: tuneLcd, event: {change: changeTuneLcd}, enable: tuneEnabled">
            <small>Independent of chamber lights. Local activity or opening the door wakes the LCD.</small>
        </div>
        <details data-bind="visible: chamberLightPrinterBusy"><summary>Current-print brightness</summary>
            <p>Temporary overrides only; saved profiles are unchanged.</p>
            <div data-bind="foreach: printBrightnessRows">
                <div data-bind="visible: $root.tune()[kind + '_print'] >= 0">
                    <label><span data-bind="text: label"></span>: <span data-bind="text: $root.tune()[kind + '_print']"></span>%</label>
                    <input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" data-bind="value: draft, enable: $root.tuneEnabled, attr: {'aria-label': label + ' print brightness'}">
                    <button class="btn" data-bind="click: $root.applyPrintBrightness, enable: $root.tuneEnabled">Apply</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </details>
        <label>Speed (%) — printer: <span data-bind="text: tune().speed"></span>%</label>
        <input type="number" min="10" max="300" class="input-small" data-bind="value: tuneSpeed, enable: tuneEnabled">
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: applyTuneSpeed, enable: tuneEnabled">Apply speed</button>
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: toggleTuneStealth, enable: tuneEnabled, text: Number(tune().stealth) ? 'Stealth: On' : 'Stealth: Off', attr: {'aria-pressed': !!Number(tune().stealth)}"></button>
        <div data-bind="foreach: tuneFlows">
            <label><span data-bind="text: label"></span> flow — printer: <span data-bind="text: actual"></span>%</label>
            <input type="number" min="50" max="150" class="input-small" data-bind="value: draft, enable: $root.tuneEnabled">
            <button class="btn" data-bind="click: $root.applyTuneFlow, enable: $root.tuneEnabled">Apply flow</button>
        </div>
        <p data-bind="visible: !tuneEnabled()">Waiting for current printer state, or controls are locked by a transfer/printer lock.</p>
        <h5>Live tool mapping</h5><p data-bind="text: liveMapping"></p>
        <small>Logical G-code tools are zero-based; printer tool labels are one-based. Mapping changes are made before a print.</small>
    </section>
    <div class="rme-card" data-bind="visible: liveMapping"><h4>Live tool mapping</h4><p data-bind="text: liveMapping"></p></div>
    <div class="rme-status-line">
        <span class="label" data-bind="css: connectionClass, text: connectionText"></span>
        <span class="rme-active-tool" data-bind="visible: activeToolVisible, attr: {title: activeToolText}">
            <span class="rme-color-dot" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: activeToolColor}"></span>
            <strong data-bind="text: activeToolText"></strong>
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card" data-bind="visible: workflowVisible">
        <h4><span data-bind="text: workflowTitle"></span> <small data-bind="text: workflowState"></small></h4>
        <div class="progress progress-striped" data-bind="css: {active: workflowIndeterminate}">
            <div class="bar" data-bind="style: {width: workflowWidth}"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="rme-workflow-message" data-bind="text: workflowMessage"></p>
        <small data-bind="text: workflowTiming"></small>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card rme-prompt" data-bind="visible: hasFirmwarePrompt">
        <h4><span data-bind="text: workflowTitle"></span>: action required</h4>
        <p data-bind="text: promptMessage"></p>
        <div data-bind="foreach: indxSlots">
            <button class="btn" data-bind="text: label, click: $root.selectIndxSlot"></button>
        </div>
        <div data-bind="foreach: promptActions">
            <button class="btn" data-bind="text: $data, click: $parent.respond"></button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card rme-prompt" data-bind="visible: pendingNewSpool">
        <h4>Configure filament selected on printer</h4>
        <p>The printer selected a new or unlinked material for tool <strong data-bind="text: pendingNewSpool() && pendingNewSpool().tool"></strong>. This form survives refreshes.</p>
        <p data-bind="visible: pendingNewSpools().length > 1">Pending tools, in order:
            <span data-bind="foreach: pendingNewSpools">
                <button class="btn btn-mini"
                        data-bind="click: $parent.activatePendingSpool,
                                   css: {'btn-primary': $parent.pendingNewSpool() && Number($parent.pendingNewSpool().tool) === Number(tool)},
                                   text: 'T' + tool"></button>
            </span>
        </p>
        <div class="form-inline rme-spool-form">
            <label>Name <input class="input-medium" data-bind="value: newSpoolName"></label>
            <label>Vendor <input class="input-small" data-bind="value: newSpoolVendor"></label>
            <label>Material <input class="input-small" data-bind="value: newSpoolMaterial"></label>
            <label>Color <input type="color" data-bind="value: newSpoolColor"></label>
            <label>Color name <input class="input-small" data-bind="value: newSpoolColorName"></label>
            <label>Initial weight <input class="input-small" type="number" min="1" data-bind="value: newSpoolWeight"> g</label>
            <label>Nozzle <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: newSpoolNozzle"> °C</label>
            <label>Bed <input class="input-mini" type="number" min="0" max="500" data-bind="value: newSpoolBed"> °C</label>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: createSpool">Create, select, and sync</button>
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: cancelNewSpool">Dismiss</button>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card rme-prompt" data-bind="visible: pendingProviderSync">
        <h4>Filament provider changed</h4>
        <p data-bind="text: pendingProviderSync() && pendingProviderSync().message"></p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: showFilamentMapping">Review all tool mappings</button>
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: cancelProviderSync">Keep printer selections</button>
        <p class="help-block">This prompt persists across refreshes. Keeping the printer selections reads them back into the active provider.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card">
        <h4>Filament and tool state</h4>
        <p><span class="label" data-bind="css: {'label-success': spoolmanager().available, 'label-warning': !spoolmanager().available}, text: spoolmanagerStatus"></span></p>
        <p class="alert alert-info" data-bind="visible: externalSpoolProvider, text: spoolOwnershipText"></p>
        <ul data-bind="visible: internalSpoolProvider, foreach: publishedSpools">
            <li><span class="rme-color-dot" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: color}"></span> <span data-bind="text: $parent.spoolLabel($data)"></span></li>
        </ul>
        <p data-bind="visible: selectedSpools().length"><strong>Loaded assignments:</strong>
            <span data-bind="foreach: selectedSpools"><span class="rme-assignment" data-bind="text: 'T' + tool + ': ' + display_name"></span></span>
        </p>
        <p data-bind="visible: loadedFilaments().length"><strong>Printer-reported loadout:</strong>
            <span data-bind="foreach: loadedFilaments"><span class="rme-assignment"><span class="rme-color-dot" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: color}"></span> <span data-bind="text: $parent.loadedFilamentLabel($data)"></span></span></span>
        </p>
        <div class="rme-firmware-action-row">
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: syncFilamentsFromPrinter, enable: canSyncFilaments">Printer → provider</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: syncFilamentsToPrinter, enable: canSyncFilaments">Provider → printer</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-bind="click: showFilamentMapping"><i class="fa fa-random"></i> Map printer tools to spools</button>
        </div>
        <p><small>All tools can be staged together; graphical mapping offers same-material spools only.</small></p>
    </div>

    <div id="rme-tab-firmware" class="rme-card form-horizontal">
        {% include "rme_compatibility_firmware_controls.jinja2" %}
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card rme-prompt" data-bind="visible: hasToolmapPrompt, event: {focusin: touchToolmap, mousedown: touchToolmap, keydown: touchToolmap}">
        <h4>Tool mapping before print</h4>
        <p data-bind="text: promptMessage"></p>
        <p><small data-bind="text: toolmapTimeoutText"></small></p>
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: useRecommendedMapping, enable: prompt().recommendation">Use suggested mapping</button>
        <p class="help-block">Suggestions match material first, then minimize total RGB color difference without assigning a tool twice. Review before continuing.</p>
        <p class="text-warning" data-bind="visible: !graphicalMappingRows().length">Slicer material metadata unavailable. No verified suggestion can be made; default mapping still requires the normal filament validation.</p>
        <div class="rme-routing-cards" data-bind="foreach: graphicalMappingRows">
            <section class="rme-route-card">
                <div class="rme-route-source"><span class="rme-spool-swatch" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: $root.mappingColor($root.mappingRequirement($data).color)}"></span>
                    <strong data-bind="text: 'Slicer T' + logical"></strong> <span data-bind="text: $root.mappingRequirement($data).material"></span>
                    <span class="rme-route-arrow" aria-label="maps to">→</span><strong data-bind="text: 'Physical T' + physical()"></strong>
                </div>
                <div class="rme-route-choices" data-bind="foreach: $root.mappingChoices($data)">
                    <button type="button" class="btn rme-tool-choice" data-bind="enable: compatible, css: {selected: $parent.physical() === tool}, attr: {'aria-pressed': $parent.physical() === tool}, click: function() {$root.chooseMappingTool($parent, $data);}">
                        <span class="rme-spool-swatch" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: color}"></span><span data-bind="text: label"></span>
                        <small data-bind="visible: suggested">Suggested</small>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
        <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: mappingEnabled"> Enable remapping</label>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: applyToolmap, enable: materialMappingValid">Apply mapping and continue print</button>
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: resetToolmap">Use default mapping and continue</button>
        <p class="help-block">No print-file G-code is sent until this mapping is confirmed. Validation runs afterward against the remapped physical tools.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card" data-bind="visible: hasMachine() && spooljoin().supported !== false">
        <h4>SpoolJoin — automatic fallback</h4>
        <p>Physical tools are used in chain order when filament runs out. These joins apply to the print session, not a saved printer setting.</p>
        <button class="btn" data-bind="click: querySpooljoin">Refresh</button>
        <div data-bind="visible: spooljoin().supported === true">
            <ul data-bind="foreach: spooljoin().entries || []"><li data-bind="text: 'T' + from + ' → T' + to"></li></ul>
            <div class="rme-join-editor">
                <label>From <select data-bind="options: physicalTools, value: spooljoinFrom, optionsText: mappingToolLabel"></select></label>
                <label>Fallback <select data-bind="options: physicalTools, value: spooljoinTo, optionsText: mappingToolLabel"></select></label>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" data-bind="click: addSpooljoin">Append fallback</button>
                <button class="btn" data-bind="click: resetSpooljoin">Clear all joins</button>
            </div>
            <p class="help-block">Choose compatible loaded materials. The firmware rejects disabled tools, duplicate destinations and loops.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rme-card" data-bind="visible: hasMachine">
        <h4>Discovered machine</h4>
        <p data-bind="text: machineSummary"></p>
        <p><strong>Current theme:</strong>
            <span data-bind="visible: !currentThemeRows().length">Not reported yet</span>
            <span data-bind="foreach: currentThemeRows">
                <span class="rme-theme-current"><span class="rme-color-dot" data-bind="style: {backgroundColor: color}"></span> <span data-bind="text: label + ' ' + color"></span></span>
            </span>
        </p>
        <p data-bind="text: currentLightsText"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="rme-card" data-bind="visible: statsRows().length">
        <h4>RME printer statistics</h4>
        <p>Lifetime and print counters reported directly by the firmware.</p>
        <dl class="dl-horizontal" data-bind="foreach: statsRows">
            <dt data-bind="text: label"></dt><dd data-bind="text: value"></dd>
        </dl>
    </div>

</div>
